# INVWINKC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a code wider
# than its column.  Locations > Location types, New adds the type
# WWWWWWWW, eight of Helv's widest capitals, named Wide with order 9:
# its row, added last and selected, draws the code clipped at its
# column's room and is marked CUT, the other rows and the header whole
# (WIDE); then the type WWWWWW, Wide, order 10, whose code ends in its
# column's gap and is CUT all the same (GAP); the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINKC.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L T
K ALT-N
T WWWWWWWW
K TAB
T Wide
K TAB
T 9
K ENTER
S WIDE
K ALT-N
T WWWWWW
K TAB
T Wide
K TAB
T 10
K ENTER
S GAP
K ESC ALT-F X
